WEBVTT

00:48:29.076 --> 00:48:31.836
let alone actually
bring them in as members.

00:48:31.836 --> 00:48:36.156
And part of that is a lack of experience

00:48:36.196 --> 00:48:40.636
and lack of any business
being in that position

00:48:40.676 --> 00:48:42.116
in the run-up to this crisis.

00:48:42.156 --> 00:48:46.956
So I’m very deeply conflicted
in my personal views on Zelenskyy,

00:48:46.956 --> 00:48:49.476
given the way he behaved
before the invasion,

00:48:49.516 --> 00:48:53.716
compared to the extraordinary leadership
that he has displayed to all of us

00:48:53.756 --> 00:48:55.276
over the last two weeks.

00:48:55.796 --> 00:48:57.676
BG: Ian, thank you for taking the time,

00:48:57.716 --> 00:49:00.276
for sharing your knowledge,
and your analysis with us.